# script-ch40.rpyc:35
translate chinese ch40_main_b68875d5:

    # "It's an ordinary school day, like any other."
    "这是再普通不过的一个上学日。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:36
translate chinese ch40_main_ee6fbe40:

    # "As usual, I'm surrounded by couples and friend groups walking to school together."
    "和往常一样，我身边尽是结伴上学的情侣和朋友。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:37
translate chinese ch40_main_2848646c:

    # "I always tell myself it's about time I meet some girls or something like that..."
    "我总告诉自己，是时候认识几个女孩子什么的了……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:39
translate chinese ch40_main_63ef6bb1:

    # s "Hey, [player]..."
    s "嘿，[player]……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:40
translate chinese ch40_main_3c88e505:

    # "...Well, there already is one girl."
    "……好吧，其实已经有那么一个女孩子了。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:41
translate chinese ch40_main_80f1ba46:

    # "That girl is Sayori, my neighbor and good friend since we were children."
    "她是纱世里，我的邻居，也是从小玩到大的好朋友。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:42
translate chinese ch40_main_1c9ccf9b:

    # "We used to walk to school together every day..."
    "我们以前每天一起走路上学……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:43
translate chinese ch40_main_cf52369a:

    # "...And recently, we've picked up that habit once again."
    "……而最近，我们又拾起了这个习惯。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:44
translate chinese ch40_main_7e0bee55:

    # s "[player], are you proud of me?"
    s "[player]，你为我骄傲吗？"

# script-ch40.rpyc:45
translate chinese ch40_main_8543d31a:

    # mc "Eh? For what?"
    mc "诶？为什么？"

# script-ch40.rpyc:46
translate chinese ch40_main_f76e9b54:

    # s 1c "You know..."
    s 1c "你看嘛……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:47
translate chinese ch40_main_aa2880a0:

    # s "For waking up on time!"
    s "因为我今天按时起床了！"

# script-ch40.rpyc:48
translate chinese ch40_main_9536b810:

    # mc "Well, you've been doing that for a while now..."
    mc "呃，你不是已经坚持按时起床好一阵子了吗……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:49
translate chinese ch40_main_846c723f:

    # s "Uh-huh!"
    s "嗯哼！"

# script-ch40.rpyc:50
translate chinese ch40_main_f6da251f:

    # s 4h "But you never even said anything about it!"
    s 4h "但你从来都没夸过我！"

# script-ch40.rpyc:52
translate chinese ch40_main_e3994ac6:

    # s "Even though we walk to school together every day..."
    s "明明我们每天都一起上学……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:53
translate chinese ch40_main_06097ca0:

    # mc "Well, yeah..."
    mc "呃，是啊……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:54
translate chinese ch40_main_3ff7743d:

    # mc "I always thought it was implied."
    mc "我一直觉得这是不用说的。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:55
translate chinese ch40_main_6da71713:

    # mc "It's embarrassing to say out loud."
    mc "非得说出来多难为情啊。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:56
translate chinese ch40_main_772f4ee7:

    # s 1d "C'mon, please?"
    s 1d "来嘛，求你了嘛？"

# script-ch40.rpyc:57
translate chinese ch40_main_defa84d9:

    # s "It's good motivation~"
    s "夸夸我能给我动力嘛~"

# script-ch40.rpyc:58
translate chinese ch40_main_e65657c9:

    # mc "Fine, fine..."
    mc "好好好……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:59
translate chinese ch40_main_550a4957:

    # mc "I'm proud of you, Sayori."
    mc "我为你骄傲，纱世里。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:61
translate chinese ch40_main_4fe8273d:

    # s 1q "Ehehe~"
    s 1q "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch40.rpyc:64
translate chinese ch40_main_f870d325:

    # "We cross the street together and make our way to school."
    "我们一起穿过马路，向学校走去。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:65
translate chinese ch40_main_6fc63fca:

    # "As we draw near, the streets become increasingly speckled with other students making their daily commute."
    "越靠近学校，赶着去上学的学生就星星点点地多了起来。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:67
translate chinese ch40_main_3142c5a4:

    # s "By the way, [player]..."
    s "对了，[player]……"

