    # mc "A club?"
    mc "社团？"

# script-ch40.rpyc:70
translate chinese ch40_main_74072316:

    # mc "I told you already, I'm really not--"
    mc "我不是说过了嘛，我真的一点都——"

# script-ch40.rpyc:71
translate chinese ch40_main_94a7f0e4:

    # "I start to say what I always do - that I'm not interested in joining any clubs."
    "我正要像往常一样说——对任何社团都没兴趣。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:72
translate chinese ch40_main_b9300a78:

    # "But something tells me Sayori would take more offense to that now."
