    mc "我想先保密。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:82
translate chinese ch40_main_5ae4488f:

    # s 5d "Boo..."
    s 5d "切……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:83
translate chinese ch40_main_9c920c3b:

    # s "You meanie."
    s "小气鬼。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:84
translate chinese ch40_main_50b00ba6:

    # mc "Be patient, you'll find out soon enough."
    mc "耐心点，你很快就会知道的。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:85
translate chinese ch40_main_0cf67faf:

    # "I used to ask myself why I let myself get lectured by such a carefree girl."
    "我以前总问自己，为什么甘愿被这样一个无忧无虑的女孩子说教。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:86
translate chinese ch40_main_1b029c8d:

    # "But I started to realize that in a way, I envy her."
    "但渐渐地我意识到，从某种意义上说，我羡慕她。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:87
translate chinese ch40_main_d6fe55c3:

    # "When Sayori puts her mind to something, she can accomplish great things."
    "纱世里一旦下定决心，就能成就了不起的事。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:88
translate chinese ch40_main_302f642e:

    # "So that's why I feel like I should do something special for her."
    "所以我才觉得，自己应该为她做点什么特别的事。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:93
translate chinese ch40_main_d234f771:

    # "The school day is as ordinary as ever, and it's over before I know it."
    "上课的日子一如既往地平淡，一转眼就结束了。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:94
translate chinese ch40_main_b631cf1e:

    # "After I pack up my things, I stand up, gathering my motivation."
