    mc "让我想想……"

# script-ch40.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch40_main_22b81a23:

    # "I recall the room number of the club from a flier I saw."
    "我想起曾在传单上看到的那个社团的房间号。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch40_main_62b4dcc5:

    # "I walk across the school and upstairs - a section of the school I rarely visit, being generally used for third-year classes and activities."
    "我穿过校园上了楼——这片区域我很少来，通常是三年级上课和活动用的。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:102
translate chinese ch40_main_708503c4:

    # "Before long, I find the room."
    "没过多久，我就找到了那间教室。"

# script-ch40.rpyc:103
translate chinese ch40_main_999eef35:

    # "I timidly open the door in front of me."
